        <mxCell id="A5nJ_8zbBgFiTso1YFMB-48" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(0, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Prediction: Client doesn&#39;t need to wait for the server&#39;s permission to change a value. The value can change immediately client-side and server is informed of the change. The server can roll back change that are invalid.&lt;/font&gt;" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;darkOpacity=0.05;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
